WEBVTT

00:03:59.376 --> 00:04:00.739
And when they do,

00:04:00.763 --> 00:04:04.296
a survivor's heart
can be pierced by a death.

00:04:05.013 --> 00:04:06.250
Let's face it:

00:04:06.274 --> 00:04:09.083
if we deny evolutionary continuity,

00:04:09.107 --> 00:04:12.827
we are really missing out
on embracing part of ourselves.

00:04:13.603 --> 00:04:16.270
So yes, I believe in the reality
of animal grief,

00:04:16.294 --> 00:04:18.773
and I also think that if we recognize it,

00:04:18.797 --> 00:04:21.443
we can make the world
a better place for animals,

00:04:21.467 --> 00:04:23.630
a kinder place for animals.

00:04:24.362 --> 00:04:27.464
So let me tell you a little bit more
about animal grief.

00:04:28.341 --> 00:04:30.559
I'm going to start in Kenya.